---
title: New cache volume · room
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px

    [*] --> count : new cache needed
    state count <<choice>>
    count --> create : [fewer than 64]
    count --> evict : [64, one unreferenced]
    count --> refused : [64, all referenced]
    evict --> count : oldest deleted, no force
    create --> [*]
    refused --> [*]

    note right of evict
        Unreferenced: no receipt that
        is not removed, no native
        receipt, no quarantine record.
    end note
    note right of refused
        graph_cache_capacity: remove
        the data of a project you
        no longer use.
    end note

    class create ok
    class refused fail
